            "{2B6AFF}AFRP Phone Shop",
            "{00BA00}Nokia 3310  - {FFFF00}500${FFFFFF}\nAppels, SMS, Annuaire, Sante, M�t�o\n{4488FF}Samsung S22 Ultra  - {FFFF00}5 000${FFFFFF}\nToutes les apps (WA, Trading, Carte, Immo...)",
